flowchart TB
 DEV[Desenvolvimento Windows] --> GIT[GitHub privado]
 GIT --> CI[Pipeline de testes/build]
 CI --> VPS[VPS Linux]
 VPS --> NG[Nginx + HTTPS]
 NG --> FE[Frontend compilado]
 NG --> PHP[PHP-FPM / Laravel]
 PHP --> PG[(PostgreSQL)]
 PHP --> REDIS[(Redis/Filas)]
 PHP --> STORE[Storage/Backups]
 MON[Logs e monitoramento] --> VPS
